Name:           count()
Description:    Calculate count of a specified element in a supplied array
Input:          Array of data to serach (data), element to be counted (target)
Output:         Number of occurrences of target in data array

// SET UP:
Set count to 0

// LOGIC:
for each slot (i) in data:
    if data[i] == target:
        increase count by 1

// OUTPUT:
return count


